{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"citreous-anorthite-dormouse","creation_channel":"mcp","description":"While rotating /rebar/prod/anthropic-api-key and re-materializing the container .env, a manual `docker compose up -d --force-recreate review-bot opcert mcp` on i-00880b2c7f13527c5 RACED the `rebar-autodeploy.timer` (which runs `docker compose` every ~2 min). The concurrent compose runs produced `Error response from daemon: No such container: <id>` and the manual `up` aborted partway, transiently leaving review-bot/opcert/mcp created-but-not-started (only gerrit up) — a self-inflicted ~1-2 min outage of the code-review bot, op-cert gate, and MCP server.\n\nRecovery that worked: `systemctl disable --now rebar-autodeploy.timer` → `docker compose up -d` → verify ps + `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` length in each consumer → `systemctl enable --now rebar-autodeploy.timer`.\n\nAcceptance criteria:\n- infra/runbooks/review-bot-ops.md secret-rotation / targeted-restart section documents the autodeploy-timer race and prescribes pausing `rebar-autodeploy.timer` for the recreate window (disable --now → up -d → re-enable --now), OR an equivalent lock so a manual compose op and the autodeploy tick cannot run concurrently.\n- The `docker compose up -d --force-recreate <svc>` examples in that runbook cross-reference the pause step.\n\nNon-goals: changing autodeploy's cadence or adding a compose-level lock in autodeploy.sh itself (a heavier design change — file separately if wanted). This is a documentation/procedure fix.","id":"fd5d-cd3d-871e-4c51","parent_id":"","priority":2,"tags":["ops","runbook","review-bot","mcp","autodeploy"],"ticket_type":"task","title":"Document autodeploy-race hazard in review-bot-ops secret-rotation procedure"},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1788047880492577718,"uuid":"7b67e870-af80-48e6-b736-72e89c462f2f"}